v5->v6:
 - 

v4->v5:
 - 

v3->v4:
 - 

v2->v3:
 - Fix led typo
 - Moved reset-gpios in pciea_port0
 - Removed wrong captouch pinctrl gpio

v1->v2:
 - Fix ptn5150 interrupt
 - Fix ecspi1 cs gpio

