Cc: Rick Edgecombe <rick.p.edgecombe@intel.com>
Cc: Sean Christopherson <seanjc@google.com>
Cc: kvm@vger.kernel.org
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260629060526.3638272-10-jgross@suse.com
